4. Law Number 20 of 1999 concerning Ratification of ILO Convention No.138 Concerning Minimum Age For Admission to Employment (ILO Convention Concerning Minimum Age For Admission to Employment) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 56, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3835);  
