12. Law Number 27 of 2009 concerning People's Consultative Assembly, House of Representatives, Regional Representative Council and Regional House of Representatives (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2009 Number 123, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5043);  
